; RT50 / PT50 (#744). Expectations never obtained by running Tecnigrafo.
; solid-space tests/corpus/casi/geom2d/ at fc8cae3da8a737510d6b61075b03ea3272228576:
; ellipse-nearest-mm-esterno-obliquo.json, ellipse-nearest-mm-interno-obliquo.json,
; ellipse-nearest-mm-punto-sulla-curva.json. Same whole carrier, start 0 instead of 0.2.
; No query fixes a choice between equally near candidates.
E = ELLIPSE center=0,0 major-axis=10,0 ratio=0.5
? bbox E -> -10,-5 10,5
? length E -> none
; PT50 replaces the provisional infinite distance / absent closest point.
; cambia con #744
? distance E 12,3 -> 2.8816126631665626
? closest E 12,3 -> 9.551207013215885,1.481084449879183
? distance E 3,2 -> 2.729927445733961
? closest E 3,2 -> 3.5015689963174745,4.683455310025607
? distance E 0,5 -> 0
? closest E 0,5 -> 0,5
; Rotate the same corpus data +90 degrees, then translate by (100,200).
R = ELLIPSE center=100,200 major-axis=0,10 ratio=0.5
? distance R 97,212 -> 2.8816126631665626
? closest R 97,212 -> 98.51891555012082,209.5512070132159
? distance R 95,200 -> 0
? closest R 95,200 -> 95,200
; solid-space tests/corpus/casi/geom2d/ellipse-nearest-mm-caso-quattro-*.json
; at 9c89fc37520266e55b6b5685ed16c62822c9efdc (ADR 0017 of solid-space,
; case 4): ratio 0.01, points on the major axis near the vertex (10,0).
; Whole carrier, start 0 instead of 0.2. Corpus tolerance 2^-44 N, tighter
; than the default 1e-9.
Thin = ELLIPSE center=0,0 major-axis=10,0 ratio=0.01
; Outside the ellipse.
? distance Thin 10.001,0 -> 0.0009999999999994458
? closest Thin 10.001,0 -> 10,0
; Inside, closer than the radius of curvature at the vertex (b^2/a = 0.001).
? distance Thin 9.9995,0 -> 0.0005000000000006111
? closest Thin 9.9995,0 -> 10,0
; Inside, farther: two symmetric feet, either may be returned (band), so
; only the distance.
? distance Thin 9.998,0 -> 0.0017320219369281486
